{section: Verse 1}
{use: six x16}
{comment: Picking: keep the intro arpeggio going over these chords}
There [Am]is a [C]house in [D]New Or[F]leans
They [Am]call the [C]Rising [E]Sun [E]
And it's [Am]been the [C]ruin of [D]many a poor [F]boy
And [Am]God, I [E]know I'm [Am]one [E]

{section: Verse 2}
{use: six x16}
Go [Am]tell my [C]baby [D]sister [F]
Never [Am]do like [C]I have [E]done [E]
To [Am]shun that [C]house in [D]New Or[F]leans
They [Am]call the [E]Rising [Am]Sun [E]

{section: Verse 3}
{use: six x16}
One [Am]foot is [C]on the [D]platform [F]
The [Am]other is [C]on the [E]train [E]
I'm [Am]going [C]back to [D]New Or[F]leans
